<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-60.4 PCT OF FORECAST STATE REVENUE COLLECTED.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-60.4 PCT OF FORECAST STATE REVENUE COLLECTED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The finance ministry said on Friday that  according to preliminary data 60.4 percent of forecast state revenue  had been collected by the end of July.</p>
</text>
